nt to MC Today! Step 1 – Log into your MaryVille Portal and accept your offer of admission. select submit! Step 2 – We offer three ways to pay your Enrollment Deposit ($300.00): Online –  After accepting your offer of admission on your MaryVille Portal, select Submit Payment to pay Online (conveniently located within the MaryVille Portal). By Phone – Call the Admissions Office at 865-981-8092 By Mail – Mail check or money order to: Maryville College Office of Admissions 502 E Lamar Alexander Pkwy Maryville, TN 37804 Paying your $300 enrollment deposit will secure your place in our next entering class. Once we receive your deposit, you will be given access to begin submitting your enrollment forms on the portal, including housing and student orientation preferences, and when the time comes, registering for classes. Early deposits will be given priority in campus housing and course registration. Should you decide to cancel your application, your deposit is refundable until May 1. 800.597.2687 Facebook Opens a new window Instagram Opens a new window Youtube Opens a new window Linkedin Opens a new window Majors & Programs Net Price Calculator Schedule a Tour Apply Today A-Z Index Academic Resources Alumni Campus Store Calendars & Dates Directory Distinctives Human Resources Lamar Library News & Publications Rankings & Recognitions Speakers & Experts Virtual Tour Campus Map 502 E. Lamar Alexander Pkwy Maryville, TN, 37804 © All information Maryville College 2026 Contact Us | Legal | Title IX | Consumer Info | Security 502 E. Lamar Alexander Pkwy, Maryville, TN, 37804 © All information Maryville College 2026 Contact Us | Legal | Title IX | Consumer Info | Security ×"
